{"version":1,"content":"<p>昨日，騰訊28周年內部全員會傳出組織變革與人員調整消息。在社交媒體上，有消息稱，「現在都在傳騰訊裁員8000人，職級13的元老同樣被裁員」「騰訊宣佈裁員一半」……今日，針對網絡流傳的「騰訊將裁員50%」消息，騰訊公司公關總監張軍在微博發文闢謠，稱是「純純的誤會和謠言」。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586074.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T12:23:53.008404+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T12:13:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T12:17:15.033343+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T12:17:15.033343+00:00","content_hash":"0ead3cd203a4ffebb8b5082edc153019474497a6e690a9d128a0759f03878136","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}